@host = http://localhost:5080

### UTCP manual
GET {{host}}/utcp

### OpenAPI document
GET {{host}}/openapi/v1.json

### Weather
GET {{host}}/weather/Seattle?days=3

### Create order
POST {{host}}/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{ "product": "Widget", "quantity": 2 }

### Current user (requires bearer token)
GET {{host}}/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Admin stats (API key in header; demo key)
GET {{host}}/admin/stats
X-Api-Key: demo-key

### Reports (API key in query; demo key)
GET {{host}}/reports?api_key=demo-key

### Legacy export (basic auth demo:demo)
GET {{host}}/legacy/export
Authorization: Basic ZGVtbzpkZW1v
